C. Arc-reversal metagraph on 4 vertices and its converse quotient
==============================================================================
class            scores      labeled  |Aut|  3-cycles  Ham.paths  cycle lengths  converse
TT4              (0, 1, 2, 3)       24      1         0          1  []             self
