 9  286      239.0                0.0              47
10  719      617.5                4.5             106
The half term r_{n/2}/2 is present exactly for even n (a bicentroid = symmetric central edge exists
only when the two halves have n/2 vertices each).  Otter 1948, CITED; values VERIFIED n <= 10.

